    {
      "content": "<div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; padding:16px; border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f2f8ff 0%, #fff5fb 100%); border:1px solid rgba(120,140,180,.25); box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(40,70,120,.10); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei', Arial;\">\n  <div style=\"flex:0 0 auto;\">\n    <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/想当高手\" width=\"120\" style=\"border-radius: 12px;\">\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1 1 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:18px; font-weight:900; color:#2b3a55;\">\n      冒泡排序（Bubble Sort）代码来啦～我给你几种常见写法✨\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:8px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.7; color:#3a4a66;\">\n      核心思路：每一趟把相邻元素两两比较，把大的（或小的）“冒泡”到末尾；重复多趟直到有序。  \n      下面默认<strong>升序</strong>（从小到大）。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Python 版（带提前结束优化）\n```python\ndef bubble_sort(a):\n    n = len(a)\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        swapped = False\n        for j in range(n - 1 - i):\n            if a[j] > a[j + 1]:\n                a[j], a[j + 1] = a[j + 1], a[j]\n                swapped = True\n        if not swapped:  # 这一趟没有交换，说明已经有序\n            break\n    return a\n\narr = [5, 1, 4, 2, 8]\nprint(bubble_sort(arr))  # [1, 2, 4, 5, 8]\n```\n\n<div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:12px; background:#ffffffcc; border:1px solid rgba(120,140,180,.25); margin:10px 0;\">\n  <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/给我\" width=\"70\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#3a4a66; line-height:1.6;\">\n    小贴士：<b>swapped</b> 这个优化能让“已经排好序”的数组更快结束（最佳情况 O(n)）。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## ✅ C 语言版（经典写法 + 提前结束）\n```c\n#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdbool.h>\n\nvoid bubble_sort(int a[], int n) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {\n        bool swapped = false;\n        for (int j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++) {\n            if (a[j] > a[j + 1]) {\n                int tmp = a[j];\n                a[j] = a[j + 1];\n                a[j + 1] = tmp;\n                swapped = true;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!swapped) break;\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int a[] = {5, 1, 4, 2, 8};\n    int n = sizeof(a) / sizeof(a[0]);\n\n    bubble_sort(a, n);\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) printf(\"%d \", a[i]);\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Java 版（数组排序）\n```java\nimport java.util.Arrays;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static void bubbleSort(int[] a) {\n        int n = a.length;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {\n            boolean swapped = false;\n            for (int j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++) {\n                if (a[j] > a[j + 1]) {\n                    int tmp = a[j];\n                    a[j] = a[j + 1];\n                    a[j + 1] = tmp;\n                    swapped = true;\n                }\n            }\n            if (!swapped) break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int[] a = {5, 1, 4, 2, 8};\n        bubbleSort(a);\n        System.out.println(Arrays.toString(a));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n<div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 0%, #f7fbff 100%); border:1px solid rgba(120,140,180,.25); box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(40,70,120,.08); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei', Arial;\">\n  <div style=\"flex:0 0 auto;\">\n    <img src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/疑惑\" width=\"105\" style=\"border-radius: 12px;\">\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1 1 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:15px; font-weight:800; color:#2b3a55;\">你想要哪种语言的版本？</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:6px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.7; color:#3a4a66;\">\n      你告诉我：<b>Python / C / C++ / Java / JavaScript</b>，我还能给你：\n      <ul style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px; padding:0;\">\n        <li>带“每一趟输出过程”的可视化打印版</li>\n        <li>降序版本</li>\n        <li>复杂度 & 稳定性说明（很短很清楚那种）</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
